{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/hTeZut7XxI7DkXRKSEr1jA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:21.457495+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/hTeZut7XxI7DkXRKSEr1jA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/cxu4aSsVG3umABuGGwCrqt4BxgAaxdyR2388xiaRHkCdT43PWdIvkO9kvrSKVsRuUpGziaiaqPQvpKelR4hic6YLcQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>关于接收2027年推荐免试研究生（含直博生）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>预报名工作的通知</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/OpOgRwlXKcvdDdOficgKwGkf0dluRG9aADo86uF8CThnlU0d3qjdVphSF3gMnVjl9EGyX7yictqH0yXIHUxwjB9Rt79LMxTcowyXM5On7uSts/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>江西财经大学经济学院接收2027年推荐免试研究生（含直博生）招生预报名工作正式启动，现热忱欢迎全国各地获得推免资格的优秀学子申请加入经济学院大家庭！</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OpOgRwlXKcsglIO8oicrHF5eWmbD455E0f5ic0KksQaugrJS7uK3TRq2JiccJ5CAric0HjcUJWcPic6ib7P8wRlNHsib4ibSQBHibGKiapjNicheh1icgsc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OpOgRwlXKctKqQ14c50vYe2ibKhoFpVGsncMibEsZszFt6wgrdicJHlqxqBcPHWAuHZGCPhqe67PgUF3Ky0pzpZ2k2WoE7C5HNycPYLveRBykM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院概况</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/OpOgRwlXKcvxXLbxPsq1YQwL06qmOVtHXpDxQyiau5JGic1FJOSKTJC7w5bDjv6n5Zwcn9iboDYrIjIzJBvxicNicBe3rUSERgXaUy0zUVgyzrXM/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院介绍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>经济学院是江西财经大学理论经济学建设主体和经济理论创新主阵地，前身为1984年设立的经济学系。目前已形成以本科生教育、硕士研究生教育、博士研究生教育以及博士后科学研究相结合的多层次人才培养体系。</span></p><p><span>学院下设4个教学系（政治经济学系、宏观经济系、微观经济系、资源与环境经济系）、6个科研机构（生态经济研究院、资产评估研究中心、中国农业农村现代化研究院、监管与治理研究中心、资本论与当代经济研究所、制度与发展研究中心）、5个行政党团服务科室。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/OpOgRwlXKcsccKnbqpPYLIB7VcvMyI2tqWS1SLsRrgpLfISibwA0JOUiaabAqCkUEOpxIxpvBzuZECTqofYseGicPkNamt9gTclvIqicBIKibQ8Q/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学科特色</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>学院于1993年获硕士学位授权点、2003年获理论经济学一级学科硕士学位授权点，2011年获得理论经济学一级学科博士学位授权点。2021-2025年，中国软科“中国最好学科——理论经济学”排名中，学院分别位居第19名、25名、17名、16名和14名，均为B+档次。理论经济学在教育部第四轮、第五轮学科评估中均获评B等级（全国前30%）。</span></p><p><span>此外，学院2010年获资产评估专业硕士学位授权点，2022年学院教师入选资产评估专业学位研究生教育指导委员会委员，2025年学院教师入选该教指委案例工作小组成员和中国资产评估30人论坛成员。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/OpOgRwlXKcsKOlxefjz2SWNO1Twkpg0JehZZ8QZwuKxrTcsBksEPZaJ1ibmhqlZCnHFNCgOjPC7lBCGFookvYvxKQc2jic9ibFBxaeibBCCIFNg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院师资</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>四十余年来，经济学院已发展为学校传统主流学院之一。学院现有教职工105人，其中专任教师92人。在人才队伍建设方面，拥有国家级人才3人（国家万人计划领军人才周应恒教授、国家级领军人才谢花林教授、国家万人计划青年拔尖人才潘丹教授），享受国务院特殊津贴专家4人，全国专业学位研究生教学指导委员会委员1人，其他省部级人才30余人次，包括省级百千万工程人选3人，享受省政府特殊津贴5人，省高校中青年学科带头人5人，江西省高校教学名师4人，省高层次高技能青年领军人才1人，赣鄱俊才支持计划、赣鄱英才支持计划入选者3人等。</span></p><p><span>学院2022年敦聘著名经济学家洪银兴教授担任办学顾问，2025年敦聘著名经济学家姚洋教授为发展经济学学术创新团队指导老师。2022年引进国家万人计划领军人才周应恒教授，实现当年江西省哲学社会科学从外省全职引进国家级领军人才零的突破。学院内部成功培育国家万人计划青年拔尖人才潘丹教授。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/OpOgRwlXKctF3zqL19BaRp6a2icAHPS6WOrpygAicyfcjVicl6cg2WzHZ0uqYy9Z20hEiaQZz5yodr4iaLgtatvJf2v971ZSNIN5de8jibHcON1MA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>“推免研究生”</span><span><span>优势</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>直博生模式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span>“推免生”可</span><span><strong><span>直接申请我院直博生</span></strong></span><span>，完成相关学业可直接获得博士学位。直博生正常学制为</span><span><strong><span>5年</span></strong></span><span>（即5年直接获得博士学位，比硕士+博士两阶段至少节省2年），而且在读期间</span><span><strong><span>均享受博士生相关待遇</span></strong></span><span>，如按照博士生标准进行奖学金补助。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>硕博连读培养模式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span>“推免生”录取到我院全日制非定向硕士研究生后，在</span><span><strong><span>第三学期</span></strong></span><span>（即硕士二年级上学期）可以选择</span><span><strong><span>“硕博连读制”培养模式</span></strong></span><span>，通过考核后也可直接取得博士研究生资格，并</span><span><strong><span>在第三年进入博士阶段学习</span></strong></span><span>。硕博连读正常学制为</span><span><strong><span>5年</span></strong></span><span>，并在第三年开始享受博士生相关待遇，如按照博士生标准进行奖学金补助。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/OpOgRwlXKcsxOIXicgjibicJvzmlo5lRtta7uiaqpKicqicQ14OLSU288l2pRR7Zk7agVpn2OeZGgICgqtryCPcUH1O38AatsdO1zG6qeIyWAEptg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>推免预报名安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>预报名对象</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，具有正确的政治方向，热爱祖国愿意为社会主义现代化建设服务，遵纪守法，品行端正。</span></p><p><span>2. 具有或预计获得推荐免试资格的2027届普通全日制本科毕业生（含本校及外校），并取得所在学校硕士研究生推荐免试资格。</span></p><p><span>3.勤奋学习，刻苦钻研，成绩优秀，学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力倾向。</span></p><p><span>4.诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果以及其他违法违纪受处分记录。</span></p><p><span>5.身心健康，符合国家规定的体检标准。</span></p><p><span>6.申请人员具有突出的科研能力与潜质，原则上具有良好的英语应用能力与较好的经济学、数学训练。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>预报名时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>即日起至2026年9月11日</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>预报名申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>江西财经大学接收2027年推荐免试硕士研究生（含直博生）预报名申请表</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>预报名的申请方式及流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.网上报名：申请人按要求填写预报名申请表，请于2026年9月11日下午17点前将上述要求的电子材料提交到专用邮箱。</span></p><p><span>联系老师：陈老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话： 0791－83816532</span></p><p><span>电子邮箱：5302517@qq.com</span></p><p><span>2.申请材料及提交</span></p><p><span>（1）预报名申请表1份。</span></p><p><span>（2）本科阶段成绩单1份。</span></p><p><span>（3）英语水平证明材料1份（如CET-4、CET-6、IELTS、TOEFL等证书扫描件）。</span></p><p><span>（4）申请人还可提交获奖证书、体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等材料复印件。</span></p><p><span>（5）请将上述申请材料制成PDF格式后，压缩成一个zip格式文件，并注明“姓名-本科学校-申请专业-手机号码”后发至邮箱。</span></p><p><span>3.学院初审。学院对申请人提交的材料进行审核，确定进入复试的名单，并通过电话或者邮箱通知申请人。</span></p><p><span>4.复试考核。学院组织复试，复试采取综合面试方式进行（具体形式根据学校后续统一要求确定），确定预录取名单。未参加复试或复试不合格者不得录取。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/OpOgRwlXKcvw1nVRdTQFcU1NWzEL6wMkKPc2aGLGJpvQfWJHyhAdia3RXOOpeHrNicJE5JRs5ZuadH2WUeDxYSAlQxIxI5KTL4ehReGLLpeYA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>接收推免生的专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/OpOgRwlXKctJAa8VlfhkE7nUqnhBmm296NkABN0R7By8IytltGVwkwpKWqHiaRcDakUZN0cwXPAQtnFIpgGJnudRMQPyLc3wc7UFDicURVNM8/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>硕士点</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>理论经济学（含政治经济学、西方经济学、人口资源与环境经济学3个方向）、资产评估，正常学制3年（入学后，在第三学期还可以选择5年制“硕博连读制”培养模式）。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/OpOgRwlXKcsmbsaHfsCjaM0k33bY5h9k2EwleTNib01iajBTxnNNgsvk0K1zwvYrFFh8uzic5dLcIVO6iaf0Al4C1PSWTBGdtYqfIe0aMlm91o4/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>博士点（直博生）</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>政治经济学，西方经济学，人口、资源与环境经济学，正常学制5年。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>欢迎经济学类、管理学类、数学类、计算机类、统计学类等相关专业的考生报考。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/OpOgRwlXKcsRpW5S34zM3sgywY7fWVHJBPwauOwNlAiaLXYnX6rDBYl8ib8YdurQP3cXNLY5QYQmBG40lPtg2nKopUox2horMickX4s9AjHlLk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>奖学金体系</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>全日制硕士研究生和博士生奖助体系包括学业奖学金、国家助学金、国家奖学金、江西省政府奖学金、优秀奖学金、单项奖学金、“三助”岗位津贴等多项奖助学金。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/OpOgRwlXKcvGzSfJnzedLF1MQtrAdkpf8ozSM4XIOWfEY7Ypkg0hS7XEc9WY19qN81wc1wNPKnkFXPvCsxD7IweyMfX0KKiaevURNNkG3Hyg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）请申请人必须保证提交的全部申请材料的真实性和准确性，我院将对拟录取的推荐免试研究生张榜公示。对不符合规定或弄虚作假者，一经核实，我校将取消其报名、复试、录取资格或学籍。</span></p><p><span>（二）已被我校录取的推免生，按照教育部要求，不得再次报名参加全国硕士研究生招生考试，否则取消其推免录取资格。</span></p><p><span>（三）请申请者务必提供自身准确有效的联系方式、联系邮箱，以免错失机会。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>学院相关专业信息详见官网：</span></p><p><span>江西财经大学经济学院：https://econ.jxufe.edu.cn/</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/hTeZut7XxI7DkXRKSEr1jA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">江西财经大学接收2027年推荐免试硕士研究生（含直博生）预报名申请表.doc</a> </span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></s